KG42.register("clusters-bc583265cf25570342d0796c",{"id":"37-dsm_auction_incentives::v142-d-CL004","paper":"37-dsm_auction_incentives","label":"Periodic price-signal update responsibility","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-CL004","label":"Periodic price-signal update responsibility","market_meaning":"Under the assumption that users respond to electricity prices by adjusting consumption, the distribution company periodically updates electricity-price signals to coordinate users' consumption decisions.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["DEM"],"process_stages":["coordination"],"scope_disposition":"compatible","scope_explanation":"This cluster is limited to the procedural responsibility for periodically updating price signals and the price-response assumption. The shared reference to R003 only indicates the identity of the distribution company and does not, based on its data-custody responsibility, assert that price updating depends on historical records.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"The updated signal has a clear executing entity, periodic conditions and coordination use, and can independently form a procedural rule. The shared executing entity serves only as a background reference; the price-update algorithm and the quantitative correspondence to AGV billing remain to be supplemented separately.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R004","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Directly specifies the distribution company's responsibility to update price signals in order to coordinate price-responsive consumption."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R003","ownership":"shared","role":"context","rationale":"Only locates the organizational identity of the same distribution company; information collection and historical-custody obligations belong primarily to CL001."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL004-C01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","kind":"shared_node","from_refs":["v141-c-R003::V::coordination.local_operator"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R004::V::coordination.local_operator"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06"],"rationale":"The source assigns both information collection and price updating to the same distribution company, supporting the correspondence of entity identity; this shared entity does not prove that price updating must use the stored historical data."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-CL004-M01","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R003::V::coordination.local_operator","v141-c-R004::V::coordination.local_operator"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R003::V::coordination.local_operator","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06"],"rationale":"The two places are the same distribution-company coordination-entity node; the references are presented uniformly, while the information-custody and price-update responsibilities are retained separately."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL004-G01","category":"upstream_missing","description":"The frozen chains do not contain a price-update expression, a signal-value object, or its quantitative correspondence to the enhanced AGV bill. What this cluster completes is the procedural assembly of the updating responsibility, and numerical price adjustment cannot be implemented on that basis.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R004::V::coordination.price_signal","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e08"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"If quantitative rules are needed later, B/C are to determine and record the updating method, signal definition and billing interface; the current procedural scope is retained, and no unit electricity-price formula is presumed."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL004-G02","category":"unverified_source","description":"The B citations on which the price-update responsibility and the price-response assumption are based remain unverified; assembled only indicates that this cluster forms a coherent candidate within the limited procedural scope.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R003","v141-c-R004"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R003::V::coordination.local_operator","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e06","v141-b-g01-e08"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Subsequent manual work is to check the sources and responsibility scope; the assembly status is not to be interpreted as source verification or scientific acceptance."}]},"rule_refs":["37-dsm_auction_incentives::v141-c-R004","37-dsm_auction_incentives::v141-c-R003"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-b52ce3b1e0fff6d7","KG40-14a3066c15f25075","KG40-3482a1190712c456"]});
